span class=\"gk\"> σιγῶσα σύνοιδε τὰ γιγνόμενα πρό τ' ἐόντα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Sol.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.15</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τά τοι ἐγὼ καὶ ἀμφότερα συνειδὼς ἔχω μαρτυρέειν</span> to both of which I, <b class=\"lex-tr\">knowing them true of</b> you, can testify, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.24</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">εἰ τέοισί τι χρηστὸν συνῄδεε πεποιημένον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.113</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐπαινεόντων τούτους τοῖσί τι καὶ συνῃδέατε</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.58</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὰ Μηδικὰ καὶ ὅσα αὐτοὶ σύνιστε</span> our other services <b class=\"lex-tr\">to</b> which <b class=\"lex-tr\">you can testify</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.73</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἂ ξύνισμεν τοῖσιν ἵπποις βουλόμεσθ' ἐπαινέσαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Eq.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">595</span> </span> (troch.); <span class=\"gk\">συνοίδαμεν ὑμῖν ὑπὸ τὸν παρεόντα τόνδε πόλεμον ἐοῦσι πολλὸν προθυμοτάτοισι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.60</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὑπολαμβάνων παρ' ὑμῶν ἑκάστῳ τὸ συνειδὸς ὑπάρχειν μοι</span> believing that I can rely on your <b class=\"lex-tr\">acknowledgement</b> of my services, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">18.110</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τί μοι σύνοισθα τοιοῦτον εἰργασμένῳ</span>; <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.